WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.000
A global variable keeps the choice when the app changes screen.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.250
On screen one, the event sets Chosen, then goes to screen two.

3
00:00:11.321 --> 00:00:15.021
Screen two reads Chosen, so it knows you picked Courage.

4
00:00:20.941 --> 00:00:25.141
Screen three clears the list, then adds each entry from the array.
